[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Caro-Kann Defence"]
[Variation "Exchange Variation, 6.Bf4 blunder"]
[ECO "B13"]
[Character "tactical"]
[Risk "low"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "trap,hanging-piece"]
[Refutes "1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 cxd5 4. Bd3 Nc6 5. c3 Qc7 6. Bf4"]
[Kind "for-us"]

1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 cxd5 4. Bd3 Nc6 5. c3 Qc7 6. Bf4? { White's bishop attacks the queen, but nothing protects the bishop. }
6... Qxf4 { The queen takes a free bishop. White cannot take back, because the bishop on d3 does not guard f4. }
*
